      "content": "that's a good start. can you keep going? specifically i need more on the actual transition period in the late 50s. also, for the sake of showing the tension in the film, can you explain what the belgian government's actual reasoning was for staying so long and what their official stance was regarding the independence movements? i need to understand their side of the argument too.",
